  m_text: 'Inception follows Dom Cobb, a professional thief who steals secrets by
    infiltrating targets'' subconscious minds during shared dreams. To clear his
    criminal record and return to his children, Cobb takes on an impossible job:
    "inception," the act of planting a new idea into a corporate heir''s mind rather
    than stealing one'
